\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Dynamite Stick x7</b> has a powerful explosion, and a large radius. Like any other explosive, it damages trees and ores, and can be used to open the gate at the <a href=\"/wiki/Skull_Rock\" title=\"Skull Rock\">Skull Rock</a> to get the <a href=\"/wiki/Skull\" title=\"Skull\">Skull</a>.\n</p><p>Unlike bombs, dynamite blows up almost instantly in a chain reaction.\n</p><p>The Dynamite Stick x7 can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/Pirate_Boat\" title=\"Pirate Boat\">Pirate Boat</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>● This item was originally priced at $7,500.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902193100\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 76/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 68/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019491/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.486      1 Template:Explosive\n100.00%   38.486      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1023-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902193100 and revision id 15306. Rendering was triggered be